<title>UK: ICI firmer after strong U.S. performance.</title>
<headline>ICI firmer after strong U.S. performance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Imperial Chemical Industries Plc strengthened on Tuesday, extending their recent bounce from last week's two-year low on the back of a rise in its ADRs in New York, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;They had a strong market overnight in the States and they're up on that really -- we're just seeing a bit of a bounce,&quot; one trader said.  </p>
<p>The stock was trading 8-1/2p, or 1.19 percent higher at 723p by 0835 GMT. In New York its ADRs rose $1/2 to $47-3/4.</p>
<p>ICI shares have bounced from a two-year low of 679p touched on April 4.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
